@lang en
IMPORT `nd67-vn27-art75`

-- Tests from the source, written by hand: every expected value is a figure, a date or a rule the
-- decree prints, worked by hand from the src lines quoted beside it. The percentages and
-- thresholds of Article 17 are tested exhaustively in nd67-vn27-art17-tests.l4, generated from
-- the raw text; this module tests the cases, the dates, the duties and the offers. Every
-- scenario whose answer could turn on the vintage is asserted under both.
-- The regulative rules are exercised with #TRACE (a DEONTIC cannot be compared); their dates
-- are asserted through the date functions.

§ `Tests`

§§ `Fixtures`

`as made`    MEANS `the decree as made`
`as amended` MEANS `the decree as amended by Decree 220/2026`

`no days off` MEANS `A calendar of working days` WITH `days off other than Saturdays and Sundays` IS EMPTY

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      h IS A `The harm to the person`
      xs IS A LIST OF `A vehicle that caused the harm`
GIVETH A `A person harmed in a road accident`
`a person harmed on` d `with` h `by` xs MEANS
    `A person harmed in a road accident` WITH
        `the accident happened on`          IS d
        `the harm`                          IS h
        `the vehicles that caused the harm` IS xs

GIVEN a IS A `The insurer's answer on the person's harm`
GIVETH A `A vehicle that caused the harm`
`an insured vehicle whose insurer answers` a MEANS `an identified, insured vehicle, whose insurer answers` a

GIVEN p IS A `A point of Article 12(3)`
      h IS A `The harm to the person`
      n IS A NUMBER
      f IS A `What was later found of the accident`
GIVETH AN `An advance an insurer paid`
`an advance under` p `for` h `of` n `, later` f MEANS
    `An advance an insurer paid` WITH
        `the point under which it was paid`                IS p
        `the harm, as estimated when the advance was paid` IS h
        `the amount advanced`                              IS n
        `what was later found of the accident`             IS f

`point (a)` MEANS `point (a): the accident had been found within the scope of compensation`
`point (b)` MEANS `point (b): the accident had not yet been found within the scope of compensation`

§§ `Which vintage answers (Decree 67 Article 77(1); Decree 220 Article 10(1))`

-- src:2009 | 1. Nghị định này có hiệu lực thi hành kể từ ngày ký ban hành.
-- src:nd220-2026-congbao-367:195 | 1. Nghị định này có hiệu lực thi hành từ ngày 01 tháng 7 năm 2026.
#ASSERT REFUSED `the vintage in force on` (YMD 2023 9 5) BECAUSE "Decree 67/2023 was not yet in force on that day: the rules then in force (Decree 03/2021/NĐ-CP and others, Article 77(2)) are not encoded in this model"
#ASSERT `the vintage in force on` (YMD 2023 9 6)  EQUALS `as made`
#ASSERT `the vintage in force on` (YMD 2026 6 30) EQUALS `as made`
#ASSERT `the vintage in force on` (YMD 2026 7 1)  EQUALS `as amended`
#ASSERT NOT `Decree 220/2026 changes a provision this row encodes, in` `as made`
#ASSERT NOT `Decree 220/2026 changes a provision this row encodes, in` `as amended`

§§ `Days`

-- "Trước ngày 30 tháng 6": the last day is 29 June (fork V2). Working days: Monday 5 October
-- 2026 plus 5 working days is Monday 12 October.
#ASSERT `the last day before` (YMD 2026 6 30) EQUALS YMD 2026 6 29
#ASSERT `the last day before` (YMD 2026 1 1)  EQUALS YMD 2025 12 31
#ASSERT `the working day` 5 `after` (YMD 2026 10 5) `on` `no days off` EQUALS YMD 2026 10 12
#ASSERT `the working day` 1 `after` (YMD 2026 10 9) `on` `no days off` EQUALS YMD 2026 10 12

§§ `Article 15 — receipts by source`

-- src:469 | Điều 15. Nguồn hình thành Quỹ bảo hiểm xe cơ giới
-- src:470 | 1. Đóng góp của các doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm được phép triển khai bảo hiểm bắt
-- src:471 | buộc trách nhiệm dân sự của chủ xe cơ giới.
-- src:472 | 2. Thu từ lãi tiền gửi.
-- src:473 | 3. Các nguồn tài trợ, hỗ trợ của các tổ chức, cá nhân.
-- src:474 | 4. Các khoản thu hợp pháp khác (nếu có).
`a year's receipts` MEANS LIST
    (`A receipt of the Fund` WITH `source` IS `contributions of the insurers`, `amount` IS 60000000000),
    (`A receipt of the Fund` WITH `source` IS `contributions of the insurers`, `amount` IS 40000000000),
    (`A receipt of the Fund` WITH `source` IS `interest on deposits`, `amount` IS 2000000000),
    (`A receipt of the Fund` WITH `source` IS `sponsorship and support from organisations and individuals`, `amount` IS 1000000000)
#ASSERT `Article 15 — the Fund's receipts from` `contributions of the insurers` `among` `a year's receipts` EQUALS 100000000000
#ASSERT `Article 15 — the Fund's receipts from` `interest on deposits` `among` `a year's receipts` EQUALS 2000000000
#ASSERT `Article 15 — the Fund's receipts from` `other lawful receipts` `among` `a year's receipts` EQUALS 0
-- Fork V12: the base of the ceilings of Article 17(1) is the contributions only.
#ASSERT `Article 17(1) — the year's contributions paid into the Fund, among` `a year's receipts` EQUALS 100000000000

§§ `Article 16 — the contribution`

-- src:478 | 1. Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm có trách nhiệm trích tối đa 1% tổng số phí bảo
-- src:479 | hiểm bắt buộc trách nhiệm dân sự của chủ xe cơ giới thực tế thu được của các
-- src:480 | hợp đồng bảo hiểm gốc trong năm tài chính trước liền kề để đóng vào Quỹ bảo
-- src:481 | hiểm xe cơ giới.
-- src:482 | 2. Trước ngày 30 tháng 4 hàng năm, Hội đồng quản lý Quỹ bảo hiểm xe cơ
-- src:483 | giới quyết định tỷ lệ đóng góp vào Quỹ bảo hiểm xe cơ giới, thực hiện thông báo
-- src:484 | cho các doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm và Bộ Tài chính.
-- src:485 | 3. Doanh nghiệp bảo hiểm triển khai bảo hiểm bắt buộc trách nhiệm dân sự
-- src:486 | của chủ xe cơ giới thực hiện đóng góp vào tài khoản của Quỹ bảo hiểm xe cơ giới
-- src:487 | theo thời hạn sau:
-- src:488 | a) Trước ngày 30 tháng 6 hàng năm: Nộp 50% tổng số tiền quy định tại khoản 1
-- src:489 | và khoản 2 Điều này.
-- src:490 | b) Trước ngày 31 tháng 12 hàng năm: Nộp số tiền còn lại quy định tại khoản 1
-- src:491 | và khoản 2 Điều này.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      p IS A NUMBER
      r IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An insurer's contribution year`
`the contribution year` y `on premiums of` p `at the rate` r MEANS
    `An insurer's contribution year` WITH
        `the financial year`                                 IS y
        `premiums collected in the preceding financial year` IS p
        `the rate the Council decided, in percent`           IS r

-- At most 1% of the premiums of the preceding year (50,000,000,000): 500,000,000 at 1%,
-- 400,000,000 at 0.8%; above 1% the rate is rejected.
#ASSERT `Article 16(1)-(2) — the insurer's contribution for` (`the contribution year` 2026 `on premiums of` 50000000000 `at the rate` (JUST 1)) EQUALS RIGHT 500000000
#ASSERT `Article 16(1)-(2) — the insurer's contribution for` (`the contribution year` 2026 `on premiums of` 50000000000 `at the rate` (JUST 0.8)) EQUALS RIGHT 400000000
#ASSERT `Article 16(1)-(2) — the insurer's contribution for` (`the contribution year` 2026 `on premiums of` 50000000000 `at the rate` (JUST 1.01)) EQUALS LEFT `the Council's rate exceeds the 1% of Article 16(1)`
#ASSERT `Article 16(1)-(2) — the insurer's contribution for` (`the contribution year` 2024 `on premiums of` 50000000000 `at the rate` (JUST 1)) EQUALS RIGHT 500000000
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 16(1)-(2) — the insurer's contribution for` (`the contribution year` 2026 `on premiums of` 50000000000 `at the rate` NOTHING) BECAUSE "the Fund's Management Council has decided no contribution rate for the year, so the amount of Article 16(1) and (2) cannot be computed"
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 16(1)-(2) — the insurer's contribution for` (`the contribution year` 2023 `on premiums of` 50000000000 `at the rate` (JUST 1)) BECAUSE "the contributions for the financial year 2023 and before are governed by Article 76(2) or by earlier rules, which are not encoded in this model"

-- The dates: the Council by 29 April; 50% by 29 June; the rest by 30 December (fork V2).
#ASSERT `Article 16(2) — the last day for the Council to decide the rate for` 2026 EQUALS YMD 2026 4 29
#ASSERT `Article 16(3)(a) — the last day for the first half, in` 2026 EQUALS YMD 2026 6 29
#ASSERT `Article 16(3)(b) — the last day for the rest, in` 2026 EQUALS YMD 2026 12 30
#ASSERT `Article 16(3)(a) — the first half of` 500000000 EQUALS 250000000

-- In time, both halves: fulfilled.
#TRACE `Article 16(3) — the insurer must pay its contribution for` 2026 `, of` 500000000 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 5 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the insurance enterprise` DOES `pay into the Fund's account` 250000000 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 6 29))
    PARTY `the insurance enterprise` DOES `pay into the Fund's account` 250000000 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 12 30))
-- The first half on 30 June, a day late: the Executive Board must urge or recover (Article 20(2)(c)).
#TRACE `Article 16(3) — the insurer must pay its contribution for` 2026 `, of` 500000000 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 5 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the insurance enterprise` DOES `pay into the Fund's account` 250000000 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 6 30))
-- Less than half by 29 June: the same.
#TRACE `Article 16(3) — the insurer must pay its contribution for` 2026 `, of` 500000000 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 5 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the insurance enterprise` DOES `pay into the Fund's account` 249999999 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 6 1))
    (`WAIT UNTIL` (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 7 1)))
-- 300,000,000 first, then the remaining 200,000,000 on 31 December: late.
#TRACE `Article 16(3) — the insurer must pay its contribution for` 2026 `, of` 500000000 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 5 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the insurance enterprise` DOES `pay into the Fund's account` 300000000 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 6 1))
    PARTY `the insurance enterprise` DOES `pay into the Fund's account` 200000000 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 12 31))
-- The Council decides on 29 April: in time; on 30 April: late.
#TRACE `Article 16(2) — the Council must decide the rate and notify it, for` 2026 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 1 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Fund's Management Council` DOES `decide the contribution rate, and notify it to the insurers and the Ministry of Finance` AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 4 29))
#TRACE `Article 16(2) — the Council must decide the rate and notify it, for` 2026 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 1 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Fund's Management Council` DOES `decide the contribution rate, and notify it to the insurers and the Ministry of Finance` AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 4 30))

§§ `Article 17(1)(a) — humanitarian support: the cases`

-- src:494 | a) Chi hỗ trợ nhân đạo:
-- src:495 | Trong các trường hợp không xác định được xe gây tai nạn, xe không tham gia
-- src:496 | bảo hiểm, không thuộc phạm vi bảo hiểm và các trường hợp loại trừ trách nhiệm
-- src:497 | bảo hiểm theo quy định tại khoản 2 Điều 7 Nghị định này (trừ hành động cố ý gây
-- src:498 | thiệt hại của người bị thiệt hại) với mức hỗ trợ cụ thể như sau: 30% giới hạn trách
-- src:499 | nhiệm bảo hiểm theo quy định cho một người trong một vụ tai nạn đối với trường
-- src:500 | hợp tử vong và tỷ lệ tổn thương từ 81% trở lên; 10% giới hạn trách nhiệm bảo
-- src:501 | hiểm theo quy định cho một người trong một vụ tai nạn đối với trường hợp tỷ lệ
-- src:502 | tổn thương từ 31% đến dưới 81%.
-- (1) A pedestrian killed by a vehicle never identified: 30% of 150,000,000.
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as made`    `, the humanitarian support for` (`a person harmed on` (YMD 2026 3 2) `with` `death` `by` (LIST `a vehicle that was not identified`)) EQUALS RIGHT (`support of` 45000000 `the vehicle that caused the accident was not identified`)
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as amended` `, the humanitarian support for` (`a person harmed on` (YMD 2026 8 2) `with` `death` `by` (LIST `a vehicle that was not identified`)) EQUALS RIGHT (`support of` 45000000 `the vehicle that caused the accident was not identified`)
-- (2) An injury of 50% by an uninsured vehicle: 10%.
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as made`    `, the humanitarian support for` (`a person harmed on` (YMD 2026 3 2) `with` (`an injury assessed at a rate of` 50) `by` (LIST `an identified vehicle with no compulsory insurance in force`)) EQUALS RIGHT (`support of` 15000000 `the vehicle was not insured`)
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as amended` `, the humanitarian support for` (`a person harmed on` (YMD 2026 8 2) `with` (`an injury assessed at a rate of` 50) `by` (LIST `an identified vehicle with no compulsory insurance in force`)) EQUALS RIGHT (`support of` 15000000 `the vehicle was not insured`)
-- (3) Harm outside the scope of Article 7(1).
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as made`    `, the humanitarian support for` (`a person harmed on` (YMD 2026 3 2) `with` (`an injury assessed at a rate of` 85) `by` (LIST (`an insured vehicle whose insurer answers` `the harm is outside the scope of Article 7(1)`))) EQUALS RIGHT (`support of` 45000000 `the harm is outside the scope of the insurance`)
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as amended` `, the humanitarian support for` (`a person harmed on` (YMD 2026 8 2) `with` (`an injury assessed at a rate of` 85) `by` (LIST (`an insured vehicle whose insurer answers` `the harm is outside the scope of Article 7(1)`))) EQUALS RIGHT (`support of` 45000000 `the harm is outside the scope of the insurance`)
-- (4) An unlicensed driver (Article 7(2)(c)); a driver who deliberately ran the victim down
-- (Article 7(2)(a), the driver's intent): both excluded by the insurer, both supported.
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as made`    `, the humanitarian support for` (`a person harmed on` (YMD 2026 3 2) `with` `death` `by` (LIST (`an insured vehicle whose insurer answers` `Article 7(2)(c): the driver's age or driving licence`))) EQUALS RIGHT (`support of` 45000000 `an exclusion of Article 7(2) applies, other than the injured person's own intentional act`)
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as amended` `, the humanitarian support for` (`a person harmed on` (YMD 2026 8 2) `with` `death` `by` (LIST (`an insured vehicle whose insurer answers` `Article 7(2)(a): an intentional act of the owner or the driver`))) EQUALS RIGHT (`support of` 45000000 `an exclusion of Article 7(2) applies, other than the injured person's own intentional act`)
-- The near misses: the injured person's own intent; harm the insurer covers.
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as made`    `, the humanitarian support for` (`a person harmed on` (YMD 2026 3 2) `with` `death` `by` (LIST (`an insured vehicle whose insurer answers` `Article 7(2)(a): an intentional act of the injured person`))) EQUALS RIGHT `no support: none of the cases of Article 17(1)(a)`
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as amended` `, the humanitarian support for` (`a person harmed on` (YMD 2026 8 2) `with` `death` `by` (LIST (`an insured vehicle whose insurer answers` `the insurer covers the harm`))) EQUALS RIGHT `no support: none of the cases of Article 17(1)(a)`
-- A case holds but the rate is under 31%.
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as made`    `, the humanitarian support for` (`a person harmed on` (YMD 2026 3 2) `with` (`an injury assessed at a rate of` 30) `by` (LIST `a vehicle that was not identified`)) EQUALS RIGHT `no support: an injury rate under 31%`
-- Bad facts.
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as made`    `, the humanitarian support for` (`a person harmed on` (YMD 2026 3 2) `with` (`an injury assessed at a rate of` 101) `by` (LIST `a vehicle that was not identified`)) EQUALS LEFT `an injury rate is not between 0 and 100`
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as amended` `, the humanitarian support for` (`a person harmed on` (YMD 2026 8 2) `with` `death` `by` EMPTY) EQUALS LEFT `no vehicle is named as having caused the harm`
-- By the day of the accident: the vintage then in force; before Decree 67, declined.
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — the humanitarian support, in the vintage in force on the day of the accident, for` (`a person harmed on` (YMD 2026 7 1) `with` `death` `by` (LIST `a vehicle that was not identified`)) EQUALS RIGHT (`support of` 45000000 `the vehicle that caused the accident was not identified`)
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — the humanitarian support, in the vintage in force on the day of the accident, for` (`a person harmed on` (YMD 2026 6 30) `with` `death` `by` (LIST `a vehicle that was not identified`)) EQUALS RIGHT (`support of` 45000000 `the vehicle that caused the accident was not identified`)
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 17(1)(a) — the humanitarian support, in the vintage in force on the day of the accident, for` (`a person harmed on` (YMD 2023 9 5) `with` `death` `by` (LIST `a vehicle that was not identified`)) BECAUSE "Decree 67/2023 was not yet in force on that day: the rules then in force (Decree 03/2021/NĐ-CP and others, Article 77(2)) are not encoded in this model"
-- Who is paid and the file to submit: left to the Council (Article 20(1)(k)), declined.
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 17(1)(a) — who receives the support, and the file to submit, for` (`a person harmed on` (YMD 2026 8 2) `with` `death` `by` (LIST `a vehicle that was not identified`)) BECAUSE "the Fund's Management Council's process, procedure and file for humanitarian support and for repaying advances (Article 20(1)(k)) are not in the sources of this model"

§§ `Article 12(3) and 17(1)(a) — repaying an advance`

