-- A point (b) advance of 45,000,000 for a death, the accident later found excluded: repaid.
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as made`    `, what the Fund owes the insurer for` (`an advance under` `point (b)` `for` `death` `of` 45000000 `, later` `excluded under Article 7(2)`) EQUALS RIGHT (`the Fund must repay` 45000000)
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as amended` `, what the Fund owes the insurer for` (`an advance under` `point (b)` `for` `death` `of` 45000000 `, later` `excluded under Article 7(2)`) EQUALS RIGHT (`the Fund must repay` 45000000)
-- A point (b) advance of 15,000,000 for an estimated 40%, later found outside the scope.
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as made`    `, what the Fund owes the insurer for` (`an advance under` `point (b)` `for` (`an injury assessed at a rate of` 40) `of` 15000000 `, later` `outside the scope of the insurance`) EQUALS RIGHT (`the Fund must repay` 15000000)
-- The accident later found within the scope: no duty.
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as amended` `, what the Fund owes the insurer for` (`an advance under` `point (b)` `for` `death` `of` 45000000 `, later` `within the scope and not excluded`) EQUALS RIGHT `no duty: the accident was later found within the scope and not excluded`
-- A point (a) advance: the insurer may ask (Article 12(3)); the Fund has no duty (Article 17).
#ASSERT `Article 12(3) — the insurer may ask the Fund to repay` (`an advance under` `point (a)` `for` `death` `of` 105000000 `, later` `excluded under Article 7(2)`)
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as made` `, what the Fund owes the insurer for` (`an advance under` `point (a)` `for` `death` `of` 105000000 `, later` `excluded under Article 7(2)`) EQUALS RIGHT `no duty: the advance was paid under point (a) of Article 12(3)`
#ASSERT NOT `Article 12(3) — the insurer may ask the Fund to repay` (`an advance under` `point (b)` `for` `death` `of` 45000000 `, later` `within the scope and not excluded`)
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — under` `as made` `, what the Fund owes the insurer for` (`an advance under` `point (b)` `for` `death` `of` (0 MINUS 1) `, later` `excluded under Article 7(2)`) EQUALS LEFT `an amount is negative`

§§ `Article 17(1) — overspending and the carry-over of point (a)`

-- src:510 | Mức chi không vượt quá 30% tổng số tiền đóng vào Quỹ bảo hiểm xe cơ giới
-- src:511 | hàng năm và số dư Quỹ bảo hiểm xe cơ giới các năm trước (nếu có). Trường hợp
-- src:512 | trong năm Quỹ bảo hiểm xe cơ giới đã chi hết số tiền được chi hỗ trợ nhân đạo thì
-- src:513 | các hồ sơ chi hỗ trợ nhân đạo chưa được giải quyết sẽ được chuyển sang chi hỗ trợ
-- src:514 | nhân đạo của năm kế tiếp.
-- On contributions of 100,000,000,000 and a balance of 20,000,000,000, point (a) may spend
-- 30% of 120,000,000,000 = 36,000,000,000. A file of 45,000,000 after 35,955,000,000 is paid
-- within the ceiling (it reaches it exactly); after 35,955,000,001 it is carried.
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — when a file of` 45000000 `is paid, with` 35955000000 `already spent, on contributions of` 100000000000 `and a balance of earlier years of` 20000000000 EQUALS `within this year's ceiling`
#ASSERT `Article 17(1)(a) — when a file of` 45000000 `is paid, with` 35955000001 `already spent, on contributions of` 100000000000 `and a balance of earlier years of` 20000000000 EQUALS `carried to the next year's humanitarian support`
-- Point (d) spending of 10,000,000,001 on contributions of 100,000,000,000 is over its 10%,
-- and the balance does not raise it; point (b) at 18,000,000,000 is within its 15% of 120.
#ASSERT `Article 17(1) — the heads overspent by` (LIST (`A year's spending under a head` WITH `head` IS `(d) support for the police`, `amount` IS 10000000001), (`A year's spending under a head` WITH `head` IS `(b) works and equipment to prevent and limit losses and road accidents`, `amount` IS 18000000000)) `, on contributions of` 100000000000 `and a balance of earlier years of` 20000000000 EQUALS LIST `(d) support for the police`
-- Two entries under one head add up.
