GIVEN charged IS A NUMBER
      ground  IS A `A ground stated for the premium charged`
      paydisc IS A NUMBER
      gifts   IS A LIST OF STRING
      vol     IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An offer to sell the compulsory motor insurance`
`an offer at` charged `on` ground `with a payment discount of` paydisc `, gifts` gifts `and voluntary cover cheaper by` vol MEANS
    `An offer to sell the compulsory motor insurance` WITH
        `the premium of Annex I for the vehicle and the term`      IS 437000
        `the premium the offer charges`                            IS charged
        `the ground stated for the premium charged`                IS ground
        `the discount offered on payment`                          IS paydisc
        `benefits offered with the compulsory cover`               IS gifts
        `a reduction in the price of voluntary cover sold with it` IS vol

-- The Annex I premium, nothing else: no defect, both vintages.
#ASSERT `Articles 75(1) and 8(2) — under` `as made`    `, the defects of` (`an offer at` 437000 `on` `no ground: the premium of Annex I is charged` `with a payment discount of` 0 `, gifts` EMPTY `and voluntary cover cheaper by` 0) EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `Articles 75(1) and 8(2) — under` `as amended` `, the defects of` (`an offer at` 437000 `on` `no ground: the premium of Annex I is charged` `with a payment discount of` 0 `, gifts` EMPTY `and voluntary cover cheaper by` 0) EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT NOT `Article 75(1) — under` `as amended` `, the offer carries a promotion or a payment discount in some form:` (`an offer at` 437000 `on` `no ground: the premium of Annex I is charged` `with a payment discount of` 0 `, gifts` EMPTY `and voluntary cover cheaper by` 0)
-- 15% off on the vehicle's claims history: 371,450, lawful; one đồng more off, 371,449, is not.
#ASSERT `Articles 75(1) and 8(2) — under` `as made` `, the defects of` (`an offer at` 371450 `on` `Article 8(2): the claims history of the vehicle` `with a payment discount of` 0 `, gifts` EMPTY `and voluntary cover cheaper by` 0) EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT NOT `Article 75(1) — under` `as made` `, the offer carries a promotion or a payment discount in some form:` (`an offer at` 371450 `on` `Article 8(2): the claims history of the vehicle` `with a payment discount of` 0 `, gifts` EMPTY `and voluntary cover cheaper by` 0)
#ASSERT `Articles 75(1) and 8(2) — under` `as made` `, the defects of` (`an offer at` 371449 `on` `Article 8(2): the claims history of the vehicle` `with a payment discount of` 0 `, gifts` EMPTY `and voluntary cover cheaper by` 0) EQUALS LIST `Article 8(2): the premium is adjusted by more than 15% of the Annex I premium`
#ASSERT `Article 75(1) — under` `as amended` `, the offer carries a promotion or a payment discount in some form:` (`an offer at` 371449 `on` `Article 8(2): the claims history of the vehicle` `with a payment discount of` 0 `, gifts` EMPTY `and voluntary cover cheaper by` 0)
-- 15% more on the owner's accident history: 502,550 lawful; 502,551 too much, and still not a
-- discount.
#ASSERT `Articles 75(1) and 8(2) — under` `as made` `, the defects of` (`an offer at` 502550 `on` `Article 8(2): the accident history of the owner` `with a payment discount of` 0 `, gifts` EMPTY `and voluntary cover cheaper by` 0) EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `Articles 75(1) and 8(2) — under` `as made` `, the defects of` (`an offer at` 502551 `on` `Article 8(2): the accident history of the owner` `with a payment discount of` 0 `, gifts` EMPTY `and voluntary cover cheaper by` 0) EQUALS LIST `Article 8(2): the premium is adjusted by more than 15% of the Annex I premium`
#ASSERT NOT `Article 75(1) — under` `as made` `, the offer carries a promotion or a payment discount in some form:` (`an offer at` 502551 `on` `Article 8(2): the accident history of the owner` `with a payment discount of` 0 `, gifts` EMPTY `and voluntary cover cheaper by` 0)
-- 10% off "for buying online": a discount in some form.
#ASSERT `Articles 75(1) and 8(2) — under` `as amended` `, the defects of` (`an offer at` 393300 `on` (`another ground` "10% off for buying online") `with a payment discount of` 0 `, gifts` EMPTY `and voluntary cover cheaper by` 0) EQUALS LIST `Article 75(1): the premium is reduced on a ground Article 8(2) does not give`
#ASSERT `Article 75(1) — under` `as amended` `, the offer carries a promotion or a payment discount in some form:` (`an offer at` 393300 `on` (`another ground` "10% off for buying online") `with a payment discount of` 0 `, gifts` EMPTY `and voluntary cover cheaper by` 0)
-- A free helmet: a promotion. 20,000 back on payment: a payment discount. Both: two defects.
#ASSERT `Articles 75(1) and 8(2) — under` `as made` `, the defects of` (`an offer at` 437000 `on` `no ground: the premium of Annex I is charged` `with a payment discount of` 0 `, gifts` (LIST "a free helmet") `and voluntary cover cheaper by` 0) EQUALS LIST `Article 75(1): a promotion is offered with the compulsory cover`
#ASSERT `Articles 75(1) and 8(2) — under` `as made` `, the defects of` (`an offer at` 437000 `on` `no ground: the premium of Annex I is charged` `with a payment discount of` 20000 `, gifts` EMPTY `and voluntary cover cheaper by` 0) EQUALS LIST `Article 75(1): a payment discount is offered`
#ASSERT `Articles 75(1) and 8(2) — under` `as amended` `, the defects of` (`an offer at` 437000 `on` `no ground: the premium of Annex I is charged` `with a payment discount of` 20000 `, gifts` (LIST "a free helmet") `and voluntary cover cheaper by` 0) EQUALS LIST `Article 75(1): a promotion is offered with the compulsory cover`, `Article 75(1): a payment discount is offered`
#ASSERT `Article 75(1) — under` `as amended` `, the offer carries a promotion or a payment discount in some form:` (`an offer at` 437000 `on` `no ground: the premium of Annex I is charged` `with a payment discount of` 20000 `, gifts` EMPTY `and voluntary cover cheaper by` 0)
-- 450,000 with no Article 8(2) ground: raised without ground; not a discount.
