GIVEN b IS A NUMBER
      e IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A figure at the beginning and the end of the period`
`from` b `to` e MEANS `A figure at the beginning and the end of the period` WITH `at the beginning of the period` IS b, `at the end of the period` IS e

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The figures of a line of Form 1`
`the figures` n MEANS
    `The figures of a line of Form 1` WITH
        `number of vehicles`                             IS `from` (n TIMES 1000) `to` (n TIMES 1100)
        `premium, in millions of dong`                   IS `from` (n TIMES 100) `to` (n TIMES 120)
        `number of accidents`                            IS `from` n `to` (n TIMES 2)
        `number of deaths`                               IS `from` 0 `to` n
        `compensation for persons, in millions of dong`  IS `from` (n TIMES 10) `to` (n TIMES 12)
        `compensation for property, in millions of dong` IS `from` (n TIMES 5) `to` (n TIMES 6)

`six lines` MEANS LIST
    (`A line of Form 1` WITH `vehicle line` IS `I two-wheeled motorcycles`,                                       `figures` IS `the figures` 1),
    (`A line of Form 1` WITH `vehicle line` IS `II three-wheeled motorcycles, mopeds and similar motor vehicles`, `figures` IS `the figures` 2),
    (`A line of Form 1` WITH `vehicle line` IS `III cars not used for transport business`,                        `figures` IS `the figures` 3),
    (`A line of Form 1` WITH `vehicle line` IS `IV cars used for transport business`,                             `figures` IS `the figures` 4),
    (`A line of Form 1` WITH `vehicle line` IS `V goods vehicles (trucks)`,                                       `figures` IS `the figures` 5),
    (`A line of Form 1` WITH `vehicle line` IS `VI other vehicles`,                                               `figures` IS `the figures` 6)

-- Lines 1 to 6 (each figure a multiple of the line's number) add up to the figures of 21; a
-- total of 21 checks, 22 does not; five lines do not.
#ASSERT `Annex X, Form 1 — the report has every vehicle line once, and its total adds up:` (`A report on Form 1` WITH `the reporting year` IS 2025, `lines` IS `six lines`, `the total` IS `the figures` 21)
#ASSERT NOT `Annex X, Form 1 — the report has every vehicle line once, and its total adds up:` (`A report on Form 1` WITH `the reporting year` IS 2025, `lines` IS `six lines`, `the total` IS `the figures` 22)
#ASSERT NOT `Annex X, Form 1 — the report has every vehicle line once, and its total adds up:` (`A report on Form 1` WITH `the reporting year` IS 2025, `lines` IS drop 1 `six lines`, `the total` IS `the figures` 20)

