GIVEN rec IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An insurer's hotline`
`a 24/7 hotline, recording` rec MEANS
    `An insurer's hotline` WITH
        `operates 24 hours a day, 7 days a week` IS TRUE
        `receives notice of accidents and losses` IS TRUE
        `guides and answers the buyer, the insured and others concerned on the compulsory insurance` IS TRUE
        `records the calls made to it` IS rec

#ASSERT `Article 75(3) — under` `as made`    `, the hotline meets the clause:` (`a 24/7 hotline, recording` TRUE)
#ASSERT `Article 75(3) — under` `as amended` `, the hotline meets the clause:` (`a 24/7 hotline, recording` TRUE)
