GIVEN status IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An insurer's certificate look-up`
`a look-up, showing whether the cover is in force:` status MEANS
    `An insurer's certificate look-up` WITH
        `on the insurer's website or web portal`                     IS TRUE
        `open to the authorities that inspect and supervise`         IS TRUE
        `open to the buyer and the insured`                          IS TRUE
        `shows the term of the insurance on the certificate`         IS TRUE
        `shows whether the insurance on the certificate is in force` IS status

#ASSERT `Article 75(4) — under` `as amended` `, the look-up meets the clause:` (`a look-up, showing whether the cover is in force:` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 75(4) — under` `as made` `, the look-up meets the clause:` (`a look-up, showing whether the cover is in force:` FALSE)

GIVEN tell IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `What an insurer explained at the sale`
`an explanation, the buyer able to tell the covers apart:` tell MEANS
    `What an insurer explained at the sale` WITH
        `the conditions of the insurance, clearly` IS TRUE
        `the premium, clearly`                     IS TRUE
        `the minimum sum insured or, for the motor insurance, the limit of liability, clearly` IS TRUE
        `the buyer and the insured can tell the compulsory insurance clearly from voluntary insurance` IS tell

#ASSERT `Article 75(5) — under` `as made` `, the explanation meets the clause:` (`an explanation, the buyer able to tell the covers apart:` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 75(5) — under` `as amended` `, the explanation meets the clause:` (`an explanation, the buyer able to tell the covers apart:` FALSE)

